                2. Arrhenius Equation & Parallel First-Order Pathways

                • ln(k₂ / k₁) = (E_a / R)(1/T₁ − 1/T₂).

                • For A → B (k₁) and A → C (k₂): k_eff = k₁ + k₂, E_a(eff) = (k₁ E_a1 + k₂ E_a2) / (k₁ + k₂), and [B]/[C] = k₁ / k₂ at any time t.

